# Below the Arks, the two arms the other flows never take alone (CoP 1-2). Status 1 and Option 1 (GMs, the Holla crag
# entered), no light held. La Theine's telepoint (Option = its crag, no own light, no lights at all): the entry 202 with
# the flag 0, not the seal 212. With the light of Holla added (a GM): the Hall's _0e3 (Option 1 = crag 1, the light held,
# fewer than two lights): nothing from the mission.
lists LaTheinePlateau/Shattered_Telepoint/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/202 HallOfTransference/_0e3/onTrigger
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=334,19,-60 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop BelowTheArks current
charvar Mission[6][118]Status 1
charvar Mission[6][118]Option 1
login
trigger Shattered_Telepoint             # Option 1 = Holla's crag, no light: 202, the flag 0
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
keyitem LightOfHolla                    # a GM
warp -236.3,-4.9,290 HallOfTransference
trigger _0e3                            # Option 1 = crag 1 but the light is held: nothing from the mission
